#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:4
msgid "Switches"
msgstr "Switches"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:6
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Network Server) > "
"Switches``"
msgstr ""
"``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Network Server) > "
"Switches``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:11
msgid ""
"The Switches tab within a network server integration provides management of "
"network switches. Switches connect network segments and forward traffic "
"based on MAC addresses. |morpheus| syncs switch configurations from "
"supported network integrations and allows for creation, editing, and "
"management of switches directly from the UI."
msgstr ""
"El Switches pestaña dentro de un network servidor integration proporciona "
"gestión de network switches. Switches connect network segments y forward "
"traffic basado en MAC direcciones. |morpheus| sincroniza switch "
"configurations desde soportado network integrations y permite para creation,"
" editing, y gestión de switches directamente desde el UI."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:13
msgid ""
"Switch management is available on network server integrations that support "
"this capability (``hasSwitches`` flag). The tab title may vary depending on "
"the integration type."
msgstr ""
"Switch gestión está disponible en network servidor integrations ese support "
"este capability (``hasSwitches`` flag). El pestaña title puede vary "
"dependiendo de el integration tipo."

